[PrintTextModified Text:今天有一大半的时间<br>都消耗在和看守捉迷藏上面了。|#0101Adv19_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（还好没被抓到，<br>　累死了……）|#0101Adv19_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
