[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛晃悠悠地走出房门外。<br>然后，碰见了梅露露。她好像一直站在门外等艾玛。|#0101Adv19_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐，你没事吧？<br>我、我听说你刚刚被看守追赶……|#0101Adv19_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，没事。我还好啦。<br>就是有些累了。|#0101Adv19_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你的脸弄脏了。|#0101Adv19_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露满脸写着担心，<br>拿出手帕擦着艾玛的脸。|#0101Adv19_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（感觉她好像妈妈一样）|#0101Adv19_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛有点害羞地<br>低下了头。|#0101Adv19_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:之后，梅露露走到<br>放在过道转弯处的水桶那边。|#0101Adv19_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那个桶应该是打扫的时候用的，<br>不过现在已经成了囚犯们的垃圾桶。|#0101Adv19_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露准备把手帕丢掉。<br>可是在看到桶里的东西后，她感到有些奇怪。|#0101Adv19_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:这是什么？|#0101Adv19_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:-4,-3 Zoom:0.7 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛也走过来，看了一下桶里的东西。|#0101Adv19_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来是一些拆得十分零碎的，像机械零件一样的东西<br>塞满了整个垃圾桶。|#0101Adv19_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我也不知道欸？|#0101Adv19_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:过道本来就不太干净。<br>可能是有人打扫了一下，把垃圾倒进这里面了。|#0101Adv19_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（多想也是白费力气。<br>　这里到处都是怪事）|#0101Adv19_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛叹了一口气。<br>这时，梅露露轻轻牵起了她的手。|#0101Adv19_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:我们去吃晚餐吧。|#0101Adv19_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。|#0101Adv19_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对温柔相待的梅露露，<br>艾玛露出了微笑。|#0101Adv19_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，我想起一件事。<br>你等我一下哦。|#0101Adv19_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她——|#0101Adv19_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

