# Choice1-1-6

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:6

[PrintTextModified Text:一如往常地，往诺亚的房间里看了看。|#0101Adv19_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground Loop:false
@SpawnExtended Path:MaskingRectangle Params:200,200,true,0.5,#000000cc ScenePosition:-7,50 Rotation:,,-10 SubId:Front
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.5 TintColor:#00ffff Lazy:false ScenePosition:10,80 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Front
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1 SubId:Front
