@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚的房间也是老样子，<br>满满当当涂满了喷漆画。|#0101Adv19_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚，今天你还是不去用餐吗？|#0101Adv19_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛，梅露露。<br>诺亚没事哦？大家都对诺亚很好。|#0101Adv19_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:大家？|#0101Adv19_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。她们有时会给诺亚送饭，<br>有时会陪诺亚聊天。|#0101Adv19_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然看到诺亚的魔法，大家有点吃惊……<br>不过，这里神奇的事情太多了。|#0101Adv19_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Flushed1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:大家也不害怕诺亚的魔法。<br>欸嘿嘿，好开心。|#0101Adv19_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（哦……大家其实还<br>　挺关心诺亚的情况的）|#0101Adv19_Ema010|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就好。|#0101Adv19_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。为了报答大家，诺亚要加油画完这幅画。<br>大家看到一定会喜欢。|#0101Adv19_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

