[PrintTextModified Text:……对了，安安她<br>和诺亚相处得怎么样了？|#0101Adv19_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:走上楼梯时，<br>艾玛向梅露露问道。|#0101Adv19_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:该怎么说呢……虽然昨晚安安回房了，<br>可是到了今天，身体情况又变差了，现在还在医务室里躺着。|#0101Adv19_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好像待在同一间房里实在很难受……|#0101Adv19_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唔，这样啊……有没有什么好方法呢。<br>有了，和我换一个房间，怎么样！|#0101Adv19_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:是个好办法！|#0101Adv19_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（马上去商量一下吧……<br>　下次碰到典狱长也要说一下……）|#0101Adv19_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和梅露露走上了楼梯。|#0101Adv19_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

